html - hypertext markup language

hypertext - a text refers to another text
markup - a set of rules that defines how content should be displayed on the 
         browser

it is a standard markup language that is used to create structure for a webpages
it acts as a skeleton 
it contains series of elements that are represented by tags


tag
<reserved word>


open tag    closing tag
<resword>    </resword>


element -it is a combination of open tag +conten + closing tag
heading
<h1>my first webpage</h1>


1) create a file with .html extension 
2) <h1>my first webpage</h1>
3) run the server



