basic structure of html 
<!DOCTYPE html>---declaration- it tell the type of the document and version(5)
root element - which contains everything - head and body
<html>
  head tag
  it contains meta data ,title,third party links
  <head>
   <title>website name</title>
    
  </head>
  <body>
    will write the actual content
  </body>


</html>





type of tags
1) heading tags

h1- h6
h1-largest heading
h2
h3
h4
h5
h6 -smallest heading
2) paragraph tags
it is used to define the paragraph content 
